--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Origem dos componentes desta pasta (Arc, https://uiarc.dev; repositório público
https://github.com/kuratlielia/arc-library). Todos são da parte grátis (MIT):
"tier": "free" no catálogo oficial https://uiarc.dev/r/registry.json, conferido
em 21/11/2026. Nenhum item do Arc Pro está neste repositório. Os arquivos foram
adaptados ao painel (textos em português, tokens do tema, partes não usadas
removidas).

- accordion         https://uiarc.dev/components/accordion
- animated-counter  https://uiarc.dev/components/animated-counter
- avatar            https://uiarc.dev/components/avatar
- bar-chart         https://uiarc.dev/components/bar-chart
- button            https://uiarc.dev/components/button
- color-picker      https://uiarc.dev/components/color-picker (textos em português; opções alpha e contrastLabel)
- copy-button       https://uiarc.dev/components/copy-button (textos em português)
- date-range-picker https://uiarc.dev/components/date-range-picker (e lib/use-today.ts)
- dialog            https://uiarc.dev/components/dialog
- donut-chart       https://uiarc.dev/components/donut-chart
- dropdown-menu     https://uiarc.dev/components/dropdown-menu
- money-input       https://uiarc.dev/components/money-input
- pagination        https://uiarc.dev/components/pagination
- select            https://uiarc.dev/components/select
- skeleton          https://uiarc.dev/components/skeleton
- sortable-data-table https://uiarc.dev/components/sortable-data-table (com um espaço para o filtro da coluna no cabeçalho)
- sparkline         https://uiarc.dev/components/sparkline
- switch            https://uiarc.dev/components/switch
- tabs              https://uiarc.dev/components/tabs (textos em português)
- text-morph        https://uiarc.dev/components/text-morph (usado pelo color-picker)
- theme-switch      https://uiarc.dev/components/theme-switch
- tooltip           https://uiarc.dev/components/tooltip
- foundation.css e lib/motion-tokens.ts: base de tokens que esses componentes usam
